  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028468/description_41e506bd-dc10-454e-ad13-9c5f9c1d58b0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"739\" height=\"63\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>При поддержке <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/last-hopee\" rel=\"nofollow\">LastHopE</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028468/description_f758d242-51de-45dd-80c2-f2dbefa0d568.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028468/description_157c2d9e-f5f0-4448-8c04-8f8d8162e91b.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028468/description_a947fa33-70cb-4a11-86e9-bda0c4607997.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Этот ресурсный пакет заменяет стандартную удочку на 3D-версию!!!</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Какую ещё поддержку модов вы хотели бы предложить, напишите в комментариях</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028468/description_29a76d26-0f64-47a6-b382-dc7203e422ca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"739\" height=\"63\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Поддерживаемые моды:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2 </a><br>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex Mobs</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Мои проекты</strong></h3><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ewewukeks-3d-wildwest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028468/description_803a67b3-4344-4df6-82f3-33d06ca7de3f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanillabookr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1240496/description_aff2e523-d0d0-422b-b692-76cde14f53bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-icon-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1235333/description_f374c7e9-cd88-499c-b761-e54d8ac8f872.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>",
